{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"23":"Commercial Transactions (Kitab Al-Buyu)"},"section_detail":{"23":{"hadithnumber_first":3326,"hadithnumber_last":3415,"arabicnumber_first":3326,"arabicnumber_last":3415,"name_native":"كتاب البيو"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3381,"arabicnumber":3381,"text":"حدثنا احمد بن حنبل، حدثنا يحيى، عن عبيد الله، عن نافع، عن ابن عمر، عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم نحوه وقال حبل الحبلة ان تنتج الناقة بطنها ثم تحمل التي نتجت","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (3843) Sahih Muslim (1514)"}],"reference":{"book":23,"hadith":56}}]}